---
interface Props {repositoryUrl:string;serverName:string}
const {repositoryUrl,serverName}=Astro.props;
---
<div class="install-guide"><div class="callout"><strong>Installation not yet verified</strong><p>FreeMCP has not validated installation commands or client compatibility for {serverName}. Use the maintainer's documentation to obtain the actual command, arguments, and environment variables.</p><a href={repositoryUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read maintainer installation instructions ↗</a></div><h3>How to configure an MCP client</h3><ol><li>Read the repository README and identify the supported runtime and transport.</li><li>Install the required runtime and dependencies using the maintainer's instructions.</li><li>Find your MCP client's configuration file or server management screen.</li><li>Enter the documented executable, arguments, and required environment variable names. Never paste credentials into public websites.</li><li>Restart or reconnect your client, then confirm the server connects and exposes the expected tools.</li></ol><div class="template-head"><strong>Configuration structure example</strong><button type="button" class="copy-template" aria-label="Copy configuration template">Copy template</button></div><pre><code id="config-template">{'{\n  "mcpServers": {\n    "example-server": {\n      "command": "REPLACE_WITH_DOCUMENTED_COMMAND",\n      "args": ["REPLACE_WITH_DOCUMENTED_ARGUMENT"]\n    }\n  }\n}'}</code></pre><p class="fine">Illustrative JSON structure only. Not an executable configuration. Actual client syntax and supported fields may differ.</p><p id="copy-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
<script>document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.copy-template').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',async()=>{const code=document.getElementById('config-template')?.textContent||'';const status=document.getElementById('copy-status');try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(code);if(status)status.textContent='Template copied.'}catch{if(status)status.textContent='Copy unavailable. Select and copy the template manually.'}}))</script>
<style>.callout{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:18px}.callout strong{color:var(--text)}.install-guide p,.install-guide li{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;font-size:13px}.install-guide li{margin-bottom:10px}.install-guide a{color:var(--accent)}.template-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-top:28px}.copy-template{background:var(--surface);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:7px;cursor:pointer}pre{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:18px;overflow-x:auto;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--text)}.fine{font-size:11px!important}#copy-status{min-height:1em}</style>